    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly presents to the market this attractive own door three-bedroom duplex situated in the heart of Grand Canal Dock, complete with a covered underground designated parking space — a rare find in this sought-after location. Situated on the ground and first floor, this spacious home features floor to ceiling glazing in the living area, gas fired under-floor heating, a contemporary kitchen, and generous storage throughout.\r\n\r\nAccommodation at ground floor level comprises an entrance hallway, utility room, third bedroom/study, guest WC, and a spacious open-plan living/dining area with direct access to both the terrace and internal courtyard, completed by a separate fully fitted kitchen. Upstairs, there are two generously proportioned double bedrooms, including a principal en-suite, along with a family bathroom and a separate storage room.\r\n\r\nResidents of Hanover Quarter also benefit from access to a beautifully maintained communal courtyard designed by award-winning landscape gardener Diarmuid Gavin.\r\n\r\nMore about the location.....\r\n\r\nGrand Canal Dock is a vibrant urban quarter with a variety of neighbourhood bars, bistros, cafes and restaurants clustered around the historic city dock. The iconic Grand Canal Theatre and the Marker Hotel face onto the scenic, Martha Schwartz designed waterfront plaza. The DART and LUAS are within ten minutes walking distance, while St Stephen's Green, Ballsbridge and the IFSC are all within 20 minutes' walking distance. The locality benefits from a wide range of multinational employers including Google, Airbnb, Salesforce and State Street."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch (1.70m x 1.07m)\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall (4.82m x 1.04m)\r\nWelcoming entrance hall with tiled flooring, spot lighting, bathroom and utility room.\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Area (7.82m x 3.46m) Max\r\nBright living/dining area with timber flooring, floor to ceiling glazing and access to terrace/internal courtyard.\r\n\r\nTerrace (3.58m x 1.30m)\r\nEast facing terrace, ideal for a morning coffee or al fresco dining.\r\n\r\nKitchen (2.27m x 1.90m)\r\nSeparate, fully equipped kitchen completed with granite countertops and appliances to include four ring hob, oven, dishwasher, extractor fan and fridge freezer.\r\n\r\nGuest WC (2.04m x 1.31m)\r\nConvenient guest WC complete with wash hand basin and tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nUtility Room (1.17m x 0.87m)\r\nProviding ample storage space, fitted with a washing machine & tumble dryer.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (2.93m x 2.30m)\r\nSingle bedroom with timber flooring.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n\r\nLanding (4.47m x 1.07m)\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (4.08m x 3.25m)\r\nLarge west facing double bedroom with timber flooring and fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom (2.27m x 1.71m)\r\nMain bathroom with WC, wash hand basin, and bath with overhead shower. Tiled floor and partially tiled walls.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (4.35m x 3.47m) Max\r\nBright and spacious bedroom with timber flooring, fitted wardrobes and access to terrace.\r\n\r\nTerrace (3.31m x 1.17m)\r\nPaved terrace which overlooks internal manicured courtyard.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (2.19m x 1.45m)\r\nFully tiled en-suite complete with a wash-hand basin seated on a marble plinth, WC and shower cubicle with rainwater head.\r\n\r\nStorage Closet (2.08m x 1.08m)\r\nLarge shelved storage closet.\r\n\r\n* ALL MEASUREMENTS ARE APPROXIMATE AND FOR GUIDANCE PURPOSES ONLY *"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Own door, three bedroom duplex apartment.\r\nDesignated underground parking space.\r\nDual aspect orientation.\r\nGas fired underfloor heating.\r\nC1 BER rating.\r\nHardwood double glazed windows.\r\nAmple storage throughout.\r\nPresented in excellent decorative condition.\r\nUpmarket development with on-site caretaker.\r\nWell-managed common areas.\r\nPrime location in the heart of Grand Canal Dock.\r\nManagement charge c. €4,375.36."
      },
      {
